'\" t
.TH "ACTON\-VERIFY" "1"
.nh
.ad l
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.SH "NAME"
acton\-verify \[em] Verify contract source code on the TON verifier service
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
\fBacton verify\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIcontract\-name\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Verify local contract source code with the TON verifier on TON testnet.
.sp
The command compiles the local sources, requests a verification ticket, sends
the required testnet payment, and uploads the source bundle. An optional
deployed contract address can be used to check the compiled code hash before
payment.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.SS "Verify Options"
.sp
\fIcontract\-name\fR
.RS 4
Contract name to verify.
.sp
If omitted, Acton prompts when the project contains multiple contracts.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-address\fR \fIaddress\fR
.RS 4
Deployed contract address to verify.
.sp
If omitted, Acton verifies the compiled code hash without a separate deployed
address check.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-wallet\fR \fIwallet\fR
.RS 4
Testnet wallet to use for the verification payment.
.sp
If omitted, Acton auto\-selects the only configured wallet or prompts when
multiple wallets are available.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-tonconnect\fR
.RS 4
Use TON Connect wallet approval for the verification payment.
.sp
Acton prints a native TON Connect QR code and a \fBtc://\fR link.
.sp
Conflicts with \fB\-\-wallet\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-compiler\-version\fR \fIversion\fR
.RS 4
Tolk compiler version to request on the verifier side.
.sp
Currently defaults to \fB1.4.2\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
.RS 4
Prepare verification without sending the payment or uploading sources.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-payment\-tx\-hash\fR \fIpayment\-tx\-hash\fR
.RS 4
Reuse a finalized testnet payment transaction.
.sp
The transaction must contain the code hash from the current verification.
.RE
.SH "TON CENTER API KEYS"
Testnet requests read \fBTONCENTER_TESTNET_API_KEY\fR\&.
.sp
Acton loads \fB\&.env\fR automatically, so the simplest setup during project work is
usually to keep these keys there and use shell environment variables only for
one\-off overrides or CI.
.SS "Display Options"
.sp
\fB\-\-color\fR \fIwhen\fR
.RS 4
Control when to use colored output.
.sp
Possible values: \fBauto\fR, \fBalways\fR, \fBnever\fR
.RE
.SS "Project Options"
.sp
\fB\-\-manifest\-path\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Path to the \fBActon.toml\fR file to use for this invocation.
.sp
Use this when running the command outside the project directory or when the
manifest lives at a non\-default location.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-project\-root\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Path to the project root to use for configuration discovery and relative
defaults.
.sp
This conflicts with \fB\-\-manifest\-path\fR\&.
.RE
.SH "PROCESS"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 1.\h'+01'Compile the local contract and compute its code hash.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 2.\h'+01'Request a ticket from \fB/api/v1/take_ticket\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 3.\h'+01'Stop successfully if the code hash is already verified.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 4.\h'+01'If \fB\-\-address\fR is set, compare its deployed code hash with the compiled code.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 5.\h'+01'Get wallet approval for the returned testnet amount and address.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 6.\h'+01'Send the payment with the returned code\-hash comment.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 7.\h'+01'Wait for the finalized recipient transaction.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 8.\h'+01'Upload the sources and recipient transaction hash to \fB/api/v1/verify\fR\&.
.RE
.SH "PREREQUISITES"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'a \fB\&.tolk\fR contract source in the current project
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'testnet funds when \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR is not used
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'TON verifier availability
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'a configured wallet or TON Connect wallet, funded when not using \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'reproducible compiler settings that match the deployed contract
.RE
.SH "CONTRACT AND WALLET SELECTION"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'if \fB_contract\-name_\fR is omitted and exactly one contract is configured, Acton
selects it automatically
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'if multiple contracts are configured, Acton prompts for the contract
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'if \fB\-\-wallet\fR is omitted and exactly one wallet is configured, Acton selects
it automatically
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'if multiple wallets are configured, Acton prompts for the wallet
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'if \fB\-\-tonconnect\fR is used, Acton skips local wallet selection and uses the
wallet selected in the TON Connect page
.RE
.SH "REQUIREMENTS AND LIMITATIONS"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'only \fB\&.tolk\fR sources can be verified
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'precompiled \fB\&.boc\fR contracts cannot be verified
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'verification always uses TON testnet
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'each verification payment contains the code hash in its comment
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'one payment transaction can authorize only one verification attempt
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'verification requires a funded local or TON Connect wallet when not using
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'if a contract with the same code hash is already verified, the backend can
skip the final transaction
.RE
.SH "COST AND BACKEND NOTES"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'the ticket defines the minimum testnet payment amount
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'if the verifier backend reports that the contract is already verified, Acton
exits successfully without sending another transaction
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'on successful verification, Acton prints a verifier link for the contract
.RE
.SH "ENVIRONMENT OVERRIDES"
The verification flow also supports backend/debug environment overrides:
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBACTON_VERIFY_BACKEND\fR overrides the TON verifier backend
.RE
.sp
Backend override values are trimmed and normalized, including removal of a
trailing \fB/\fR\&.
.sp
Example: use a local verifier backend:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
ACTON_VERIFY_BACKEND=http://127.0.0.1:8080 \(rs
acton verify Counter \-\-dry\-run
.fi
.RE
.SH "DRY RUN"
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR requests a ticket and prepares the source request. It
does not send a payment or upload sources.
.SH "TON CONNECT"
Use \fB\-\-tonconnect\fR to approve the verification payment through a TON
Connect wallet instead of a wallet configured in \fBwallets.toml\fR:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton verify Counter \-\-tonconnect
.fi
.RE
.sp
Acton prints a native TON Connect QR code and a \fBtc://\fR link.
.SH "RETRIES AND FAILURE HINTS"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'source upload is attempted up to 8 times total for transient transport
failures and explicitly retryable verifier errors
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'retry backoff grows from 1 second to 7 seconds between attempts
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'backend error responses are printed with the response body when available
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'only an explicitly retryable source storage failure permits reuse of the
same payment
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'other results after the payment claim consume the payment, including generic
internal failures
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB0\fR: Verification completed successfully, including successful dry runs and
flows where the backend decides that no final transaction is needed.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB1\fR: Compilation failed, the verifier rejected the request, wallet resolution
failed, or the payment transaction failed.
.RE
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 1.\h'+01'Verify with a configured testnet wallet:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton verify Counter \-\-wallet deployer
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 2.\h'+01'Check a deployed contract address before payment:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton verify Counter \-\-address EQDt7LL...
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 3.\h'+01'Prepare verification without sending payment:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton verify Counter \-\-address EQDt7LL... \-\-dry\-run
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 4.\h'+01'Verify with an explicit compiler version:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton verify Counter \-\-address EQDt7LL... \-\-compiler\-version 1.2.0
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 5.\h'+01'Retry an upload with an existing finalized payment:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton verify Counter \-\-payment\-tx\-hash '<transaction\-hash>'
.fi
.RE
.RE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fIContract verification guide\fR <https://ton\-blockchain.github.io/acton/docs/verify>
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fIWallet management guide\fR <https://ton\-blockchain.github.io/acton/docs/wallets>
.RE
